# Project authority

You are working on a production application.

- Always read and obey `ENGINEERING_CONTRACT.md`.
- `docs/PRD.md` is the authoritative product requirement. Do not drop or reinterpret MUSTs.
- Follow `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` for trust boundaries, roles, `SET LOCAL`, and commercial write paths.
- Track work against `docs/REQUIREMENTS_MATRIX.md`. Do not mark a requirement IMPLEMENTED or VERIFIED because a scaffold, screen, or mock exists.

Never hard-code secrets, commit `service_role` keys, implement authorization only in the UI, or use JavaScript floats for money.
